3baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"涵空阁","author":"叶茵","text":"浪说涵空未是空，一阑罗列几巃嵷。\n世人若问空中景，此景从来是梦中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22899,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔村","author":"叶茵","text":"古柳溪头枕断槎，横篙挂网几渔家。\n得鱼去换红蒸米，呼子来挑荠菜花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22900,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"萤","author":"叶茵","text":"自明自灭度方池，熠熠飞来去觉迟。\n入坐点衣情分熟，纳交元在读书时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22901,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野云庵","author":"叶茵","text":"变态分阴晴，悠悠浮太虚。\n冥与此心契，时哉道卷舒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22902,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野望","author":"叶茵","text":"白水沿堤护绿苗，鸡鸣犬卧柳边桥。\n数家虽不成村落，一梦何曾到市朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22903,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪磴","author":"叶茵","text":"不记门前路，门前一尺深。\n梅花如有语，参透老逋心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22904,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游园","author":"叶茵","text":"碧琅玕里几亭台，万朵芙蕖照水开。\n可醉可吟尤可卧，主人无暇客长来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22905,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琴堂","author":"叶茵","text":"片石邻空掌样平，吴儿曾此御瑶琴。\n琴中腔调谁人识，独有颦妃是赏音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22906,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遇风","author":"叶茵","text":"捲地沙尘扑面来，归舟不进去帆飞。\n世间何事无迟速，逆者由来顺者机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22907,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"翠波","author":"叶茵","text":"萧疏拂行云，清阴笼远汀。\n水色元无色，相逢眼自青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22908,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"叶茵","text":"柳外声残日未残，栖身未稳择枝安。\n不须过有螳螂虑，黄雀从傍冷眼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22909,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"橄榄","author":"叶茵","text":"落尽红盐子更青，馀甘风韵未为珍。\n从来独有茶知己，勘破生生一点仁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22910,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹤陇","author":"叶茵","text":"一陇以鹤名，疑是终南径。\n山灵无献嘲，出处由来定。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22911,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"叶茵","text":"壁间吟不待秋时，吟苦中宵动客悲。\n劝汝不须催妇织，家家五月卖新丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22912,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十里云亭","author":"叶茵","text":"蔽空青不断，杉径影中行。\n僧指夜无月，客嫌春少晴。\n卧龙安旧窟，倦翼乱归程。\n吟到长虹背，人间天上惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22913,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二子读诗戏成","author":"叶茵","text":"翁琢五七字，儿亲三百篇。\n要知皆学力，未可以言传。\n得处有深浅，觉来无后先。\n殊途归一辙，飞跃自鱼鸢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22914,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入山","author":"叶茵","text":"到来非俗境，一片隐心生。\n晓雾沈山色，春禽和水声。\n逢人多古貌，对语率真情。\n同在无怀世，炉熏答圣明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22915,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次吴菊潭八月十四夜韵","author":"叶茵","text":"昨雨转今晴，晴新越样清。\n恐孤秋半赏，为补夜来明。\n检点有斜影，看承无异情。\n微吟樵唱句，犹恐鬼神惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":22916,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]